{"id": "Dey8ZsBSFxt", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Part 1 of 2. Painted in Madhubani, the folk art of Mithila, Sita's own homeland.\n\nSita lived in Lanka for a whole year. Ravana never once touched her. Why? 🌿 \n\nHe gave her twelve months: accept me, or my cooks will cut you. Every day he came back with gold, palaces, the throne of Lanka. Sita placed a single blade of grass between them and answered him from behind it, without once looking at him.\n\nWhen only two months were left, she told him calmly: I could burn you to ash, right here. But my Ram has not asked me to. \n\nSo why did the most powerful king in the world never use force? Ravana answered that himself. Part 2 👀 \n\nIzzat or darr? Tell us in the comments 👇 \n\n#ramayana #ram #sitaram #ravan #madhubani", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792670962, "like_count": 128996, "comment_count": 250, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1116155474145284a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 57.926, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMLQi8JJEVlLEMlXYxhJMrGVhlV0sc56GYjselqIYRG9xU7iPaH0Q4BmnpmPQJ9uXMsUmOpoPEtBmxZs1lwrT2uexo1IkfG0cIaJM0.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Adq-run8teN0tHAFsyiFCteOkCK6c0JYWPIewgjHOlgvJzQ12jyfxOA7uBxEdhsuhwqwky4OYSsTYlKBNgtkk-Ou&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Vju5spsTyn8Q7kNvwFDFaL7&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=TdnoU2BQvvx03bHDoweVFA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTre8UNZQlLm_95hDlZ2uqP5y61E18T9sBkGijCv9y-MQ&oe=